# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Menethil Harbor

step Terenthis
  zone Darkshore
  tip Terenthis stands by the flight master, at the east end of the main street. No Trek to Ashenvale yet? Give it a minute after the hand-in: Sentinel Selarin comes to Terenthis's side shortly after Volcor's escort is handed in. Changing layer can also find her. Then back west to the dock.
  turnin 994 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Terenthis: Volcor's escort from the end of Darkshore
  accept 990 optional                     -- Sentinel Selarin, once she comes: Trek to Ashenvale, for Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar on your next Ashenvale visit

step Boat to Menethil Harbor
  zone Darkshore
  goto 32.4,43.8 "Boat to Menethil Harbor"

step Menethil Harbor
  zone Wetlands
  tip Off the boat, walk up the pier: Karl Boran on the pier, James Halloran by the docks to the north, Valstag Ironjaw in the keep, the inn (First Mate Fitzsimmons) east of it with Caitlin Grassman and Sida beside it, Tarrel Rockweaver by the north gate on the way out east.
  getfp "Menethil Harbor"
  accept 279 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Karl Boran, on the pier north of the inn
  accept 484 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- James Halloran
