step Spoils of War
  tip Timber and iron piles lie around the keep and along the harbor's walls. Careful: Nightveiled Rotheap, a level 31 elite, roams the Wetlands' shores and roads: if it comes by, give it room.
  collect 279821 quest 98197 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Khaz Modan Timber
  collect 279822 quest 98197 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Khaz Modan Iron

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East Wetlands
step Bluegill Marsh: kill these as you meet them
  zone Wetlands
  tip From the marsh head east across the Wetlands. Young Wetlands Crocolisks lurk in the pools north of the excavation site.
  tip Follow the coast north out of Menethil. Bluegill Murlocs fill the marsh; Gobbler walks with a pack in the middle of it.
  collect 3397 quest 484 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Young Crocolisk Skin
  kill 1024 quest 279 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Bluegill Murloc
  collect 3618 quest 279 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Gobbler's Head

step Whelgar's Excavation Site
  tip The excavation site sits on the hill south of the road.
  turnin 305 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Merrin Rockweaver, below ground
  accept 306 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
