  turnin 294 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  accept 295 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Ormer Ironbraid: the bigger raptors in the valley west of the dig are for your next Wetlands visit, at about 27

step The Green Belt
  tip Einar Stonegrip camps by the road; Rethiel the Greenwarden stands farther east, by the river.
  turnin 463 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Rethiel the Greenwarden
  accept 276 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Thelgen Rock
  tip Cave Stalkers and Leech Stalkers fill Thelgen Rock, the cave south-east of the excavation site. Careful: Highland Lurkers and Horrors, level 28 elites, walk the same cave among them: pull the stalkers one at a time and keep clear of the elites.
  collect 280319 quest 98282 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Unruptured Stalker Gland

step The Mosshide gnolls
  tip Mosshide Gnolls and Mongrels hold the hills south-east of the Green Belt.
  kill 1008 quest 276 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Mosshide Mongrel
  kill 1007 quest 276 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Mosshide Gnoll

