step Wetlands: kill these as you meet them
  zone Wetlands
  tip North-west from Rethiel: Mosshide Fenrunners and Mistweavers roam the riverbanks on the way, and almost every one drops flint. Black, Crimson and Monstrous Oozes fill Ironbeard's Tomb, just west of the road to Dun Modr and north of Einar's camp. Any ooze there may hold Sida's bag.
  collect 3349 quest 470 @44.6,25.6 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Sida's Bag; below ground
  collect 2611 quest 277 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Crude Flint: Mosshide Fenrunners and Mistweavers

